title: V60, one cup
coffee: 15 g, ground like table salt
water: 250 g, just off the boil
time: 2:15

Rinse the paper with hot water, and tip that water away.
Add the coffee and shake the cone so the bed is level.
Pour 50 g of water and let it bloom for 40 seconds.
Pour to 250 g in two goes, finishing by 2:15.
Any of the <a href="{{link "prices"}}">coffees on the price list</a> works; the Guji is the one we would pick.
